{"3184960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Defiant", "steam_appid": 3184960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In those dark years, we had long grown accustomed to separation and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aggressors trampled our nation underfoot, leaving every inch of land engulfed in flames of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are the indomitable Northeast Anti-Japanese United Army, operating in the snowy forests of Northeast China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are the unyielding underground radio operators during the desperate Isolated Island period in Shanghai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are the formidable Canal Detachment, a spearhead seeking swift justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are the Great Wall built with flesh and blood, standing majestically atop the Taihang Mountains of North China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up arms! We are The Defiant!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scene: Back to Moments of Crisis in History</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land we set foot upon is soaked with the blood of heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the bleak, snowy forests of Northeast China, to the heavily fortified streets and alleys of occupied towns, and to the treacherous villages behind enemy lines... Here, you will be immersed in the somber, tragic and volatile atmosphere of China's War of Resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/2cb94a99fff5603ae65fafab7fd21c4d.poster.avif?t=1787691545\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/2cb94a99fff5603ae65fafab7fd21c4d.webm?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/2cb94a99fff5603ae65fafab7fd21c4d.mp4?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level: An Immersive Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, every tree, every blade of grass, every brick and stone bears silent witness to that turbulent and heroic era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/83ddfea612d84ef259210b71c38153b8.poster.avif?t=1787691545\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/83ddfea612d84ef259210b71c38153b8.webm?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/83ddfea612d84ef259210b71c38153b8.mp4?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Firearm: Every weapon is an echo of history.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you hold is not merely a weapon, but a historical relic carrying the memories of battles fought nearly a century ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features dozens of firearms, including a wide range of rifles, submachine guns, pistols and machine guns. There are the classic Hanyang 88 rifle, the legendary Mauser C96 and SIG Bergmann Model 1920, along with many other weapons that emerged throughout modern Chinese history... In time, using these weapons will become second nature to you, and they will help you secure victory on perilous battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/d79b67737f0445becd1f8db9615c0fb4.poster.avif?t=1787691545\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/d79b67737f0445becd1f8db9615c0fb4.webm?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/d79b67737f0445becd1f8db9615c0fb4.mp4?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay: Intense and Thrilling Battlefields</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy searchlights pierce the night sky; the blade of vengeance strikes at the aggressors... When these historical moments unfold before your eyes, you will no longer be a mere spectator to history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a forgotten chapter of history, but a collective memory waiting to be revived at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/2ac40802584d7d3f9cabda886828c610.poster.avif?t=1787691545\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/2ac40802584d7d3f9cabda886828c610.webm?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/2ac40802584d7d3f9cabda886828c610.mp4?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, it is your turn to become the light in those dark years, and a part of that history.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In those dark years, we had long grown accustomed to separation and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aggressors trampled our nation underfoot, leaving every inch of land engulfed in flames of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are the indomitable Northeast Anti-Japanese United Army, operating in the snowy forests of Northeast China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are the unyielding underground radio operators during the desperate Isolated Island period in Shanghai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are the formidable Canal Detachment, a spearhead seeking swift justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are the Great Wall built with flesh and blood, standing majestically atop the Taihang Mountains of North China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up arms! We are The Defiant!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scene: Back to Moments of Crisis in History</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land we set foot upon is soaked with the blood of heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the bleak, snowy forests of Northeast China, to the heavily fortified streets and alleys of occupied towns, and to the treacherous villages behind enemy lines... Here, you will be immersed in the somber, tragic and volatile atmosphere of China's War of Resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/2cb94a99fff5603ae65fafab7fd21c4d.poster.avif?t=1787691545\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/2cb94a99fff5603ae65fafab7fd21c4d.webm?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/2cb94a99fff5603ae65fafab7fd21c4d.mp4?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level: An Immersive Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, every tree, every blade of grass, every brick and stone bears silent witness to that turbulent and heroic era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/83ddfea612d84ef259210b71c38153b8.poster.avif?t=1787691545\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/83ddfea612d84ef259210b71c38153b8.webm?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/83ddfea612d84ef259210b71c38153b8.mp4?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Firearm: Every weapon is an echo of history.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you hold is not merely a weapon, but a historical relic carrying the memories of battles fought nearly a century ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features dozens of firearms, including a wide range of rifles, submachine guns, pistols and machine guns. There are the classic Hanyang 88 rifle, the legendary Mauser C96 and SIG Bergmann Model 1920, along with many other weapons that emerged throughout modern Chinese history... In time, using these weapons will become second nature to you, and they will help you secure victory on perilous battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/d79b67737f0445becd1f8db9615c0fb4.poster.avif?t=1787691545\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/d79b67737f0445becd1f8db9615c0fb4.webm?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/d79b67737f0445becd1f8db9615c0fb4.mp4?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay: Intense and Thrilling Battlefields</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy searchlights pierce the night sky; the blade of vengeance strikes at the aggressors... When these historical moments unfold before your eyes, you will no longer be a mere spectator to history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a forgotten chapter of history, but a collective memory waiting to be revived at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/2ac40802584d7d3f9cabda886828c610.poster.avif?t=1787691545\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/2ac40802584d7d3f9cabda886828c610.webm?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/extras/2ac40802584d7d3f9cabda886828c610.mp4?t=1787691545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, it is your turn to become the light in those dark years, and a part of that history.</p>", "short_description": "Heroic stories from the Chinese battlefields of World War II will be brought to life in the form of a FPS game.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Turkish, Czech, Japanese, Polish, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/daf3468e52296bead72ad56ae362f7bfcaa5909c/header.jpg?t=1787691545", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/76236656d928fb2f616947b45d5b4a50c6766c86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787691545", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184960/76236656d928fb2f616947b45d5b4a50c6766c86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787691545", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<str